WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.160
Should India grow genetically

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.560
modified mustard?

3
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.140
Meher and Arun, two made up

4
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.240
friends, will argue it on a wall

5
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.940
beside a mustard field.

6
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.270
The mustard takes no side.

7
00:00:12.764 --> 00:00:15.064
India imports more than half of

8
00:00:15.064 --> 00:00:16.854
its edible oil.

9
00:00:16.854 --> 00:00:19.184
A mustard that yields more could

10
00:00:19.184 --> 00:00:20.494
cut that bill.

11
00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:22.728
This one also carries a

12
00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:24.788
herbicide tolerance trait, and

13
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:26.708
petitioners say India has no

14
00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:28.718
guidelines to test for it.

15
00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.521
The approval is conditional.

16
00:00:31.521 --> 00:00:33.921
Experts decided it, and it can

17
00:00:33.921 --> 00:00:36.371
be revoked if harm shows up.

18
00:00:36.765 --> 00:00:38.485
One judge found the process

19
00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:40.545
rushed: a professor's warning

20
00:00:40.545 --> 00:00:42.735
about honeybees was overlooked.

21
00:00:43.225 --> 00:00:45.185
Its developers report yields

22
00:00:45.185 --> 00:00:46.765
about a quarter higher than

23
00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:47.985
traditional varieties.

24
00:00:47.985 --> 00:00:50.915
More oil from the same field.

25
00:00:51.357 --> 00:00:53.117
Farmers could come to depend on

26
00:00:53.117 --> 00:00:54.957
a few companies for seed.

27
00:00:54.957 --> 00:00:57.137
Long term health effects, and

28
00:00:57.137 --> 00:00:59.417
effects on non GM fields, are

29
00:00:59.417 --> 00:01:00.747
open questions.

30
00:01:01.339 --> 00:01:02.799
What the courts have said.

31
00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:06.139
In October 2022, the regulator,

32
00:01:06.139 --> 00:01:08.599
GEAC, gave a conditional

33
00:01:08.599 --> 00:01:11.999
approval. In July 2024, two

34
00:01:11.999 --> 00:01:13.759
Supreme Court judges split on

35
00:01:13.759 --> 00:01:16.119
it: one quashed it, one upheld

36
00:01:16.119 --> 00:01:17.979
it. Both asked for a national

37
00:01:17.979 --> 00:01:20.439
policy on GM crops, made with

38
00:01:20.439 --> 00:01:21.519
states and farmers.

39
00:01:21.519 --> 00:01:24.379
A larger bench is to decide, and

40
00:01:24.379 --> 00:01:27.179
by November 2026 no final ruling

41
00:01:27.179 --> 00:01:28.549
has been reported.

42
00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:30.998
For GS3 and the essay:

43
00:01:30.998 --> 00:01:32.838
both sides, fairly.

44
00:01:32.838 --> 00:01:35.588
Then a balanced way forward.

45
00:01:36.531 --> 00:01:38.831
The tea has gone cold.

46
00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:41.591
The mustard is still yellow, and

47
00:01:41.591 --> 00:01:43.641
the question is still open.
